---
import Section from "@/components/ui/Section.astro";
import ButtonLink from "@/components/ui/ButtonLink.astro";
---

<Section id="support" containerClass="narrow center">
  <h2>Support the work</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to keep our projects freely accessible and free from
    advertisements. Maintaining open-source software still requires
    resources — including servers, domains, testing, and ongoing
    development.
  </p>
  <p>
    Contributions help sustain the infrastructure and the work behind
    these projects.
  </p>
  <div class="actions center">
    <ButtonLink href="https://opencollective.com/sadaqahcode" blank>
      Open Collective
    </ButtonLink>
    <ButtonLink href="https://github.com/sponsors/SadaqahCode" variant="ghost" blank>
      GitHub Sponsors
    </ButtonLink>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">
    You can also contribute by sharing projects, reporting bugs,
    contributing your skills, or making dua.
  </p>
</Section>
